'''Level 2 Spiders''' wander around the room unpredictably and crawl towards Isaac if he is nearby. They combine the abilities of both the normal {{e|Spider}} and the {{e|Trite}}, though unlike the Trite, they do not leap as often and not as far.
{{clear}}

